{
  "id": 525144117,
  "iid": 26321,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Draft: UDX: add enhanced dissector with flow analysis and diagnostics",
  "description": "Enhance flow pairing: require two consecutive confirmations + remote_id hint. Dynamic SACK parsing with validation of empty/overlapping ranges and malformed data. Add per-flow counters for retransmissions, SACKs, MTU probes. Aggregated SACK RTT statistics (avg/min/max). Receive window anomaly detection, ACK storm detection, inter-packet jitter. Additional expert fields (sack_invalid, jitter, message, malformed). Follow Stream substream support, enhanced Info column tags, TAP statistics. Stricter validation (magic/version check on direct calls), optimized ACK loop, and correct MTU probe detection (requires DATA/END).\n\nTested with attached pcap (DATA, SACK, retransmissions, MTU probes) on Linux/GCC 13.\n\nSigned-off-by: Grigoriy Pelykh pelykh.g@proton.me",
  "state": "closed",
