      "title": "UDX: add enhanced dissector with flow analysis and diagnostics",
      "message": "UDX: add enhanced dissector with flow analysis and diagnostics\n\nEnhance flow pairing: require two consecutive confirmations + remote_id hint.\nDynamic SACK parsing with validation of empty/overlapping ranges and malformed data.\nAdd per-flow counters for retransmissions, SACKs, MTU probes.\nAggregated SACK RTT statistics (avg/min/max).\nReceive window anomaly detection, ACK storm detection, inter-packet jitter.\nAdditional expert fields (sack_invalid, jitter, message, malformed).\nFollow Stream substream support, enhanced Info column tags, TAP statistics.\nStricter validation (magic/version check on direct calls), optimized ACK loop,\nand correct MTU probe detection (requires DATA/END).\n\nTested with attached pcap (DATA, SACK, retransmissions, MTU probes) on Linux/GCC 13.\n\nSigned-off-by: Grigoriy Pelykh <pelykh.g@proton.me>\n",
      "author_name": "Grigoriy Pelykh",
      "author_email": "pelykh.g@proton.me",
      "authored_date": "2026-08-28T08:47:37.000+02:00",
